            "text": "上一段讲到「Lasso 回归」。现在把镜头转向「SIFT」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：研究者为什么需要「SIFT」？当时已有的方法究竟卡在了哪里？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "视觉系统需要能在视角和尺度变化下匹配同一物体的特征。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-object-recognition-from-local-scale-invariant-features"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "SIFT 构建尺度空间、寻找显著关键点、分配方向，并保存梯度直方图描述子。 关键机制是尺度不变局部特征，它把资料线索与可见的演示行为连接起来。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-object-recognition-from-local-scale-invariant-features"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 SIFT 视为深度学习之前计算机视觉中标志性的手工特征。它的长期影响在于塑造了局部描述子、运动恢复结构流程、匹配基准和稳健视觉对应背后的特征工程思路。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-object-recognition-from-local-scale-invariant-features"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
